=== BATCH SCREENING TASK ===
Review: Cyclo‐oxygenase (COX) inhibitors for treating preterm labour
Total studies to screen: 20

SELECTION CRITERIA:
All published and unpublished randomised trials in which COX inhibitors were used for tocolysis for women in labour 
