│ Review objective: To assess the effects on maternal and neonatal outcomes of COX inhibitors administered as a        │
│ tocolytic agent to women in preterm labour when compared with (i) placebo or no intervention and (ii) other          │
│ tocolytics. In addition, to compare the effects of non‐selective COX inhibitors with COX‐2 selective inhibitors.     │
