  {"study_index": 25, "title": "The effects of indomethacin and terbutaline on human fetal umbilical artery             
  velocimetry: a randomized, double‐blind study", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE Our purpose was to study the effects of        
  indomethacin and terbutaline on umbilical artery impedance as measured by the systolic/diastolic ratio. STUDY DESIGN  
  Normal, low-risk patients at 26 to 32 weeks\' gestation were enrolled. A baseline evaluation of the umbilical artery  
